# What owned files leave out is reported as the workspace opens, each file in turn (#303's
# review, S1). tests/drive.rs writes Ashfall.canvas and Lahar.canvas, each with a card whose
# id is empty, which the engine doesn't take: both boards' reports show, one after the other.
size 160x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
wait-for canvas couldn't read Ashfall.canvas: card 1 (id "") is left out: its place is empty or longer than 1024 bytes
wait-for canvas couldn't read Lahar.canvas: card 1 (id "") is left out: its place is empty or longer than 1024 bytes
wait-gone couldn't read
expect ? help  q quit
keys q
exits 0
